<view class="safe-page emergency-page" role="main" aria-label="现实支持资源">
  <view class="emergency-header">
    <text class="page-kicker">现实资源</text>
    <text class="page-title">先把人连接上</text>
    <view class="header-rule" aria-hidden="true"></view>
  </view>

  <view class="resource-intro" role="note">这里不提供热线号码库，也不判断你是否处于危机。紧急时，请优先找能真实到场或及时回应的帮助。</view>

  <view class="resource-list" aria-label="现实支持方向">
    <view wx:for="{{resources}}" wx:key="title" class="resource-row">
      <view class="resource-corner" aria-hidden="true">
        <view class="resource-corner__vertical"></view>
        <view class="resource-corner__top"></view>
      </view>
      <view class="resource-copy">
        <text class="resource-title">{{item.title}}</text>
        <text class="resource-text">{{item.text}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="boundary-note">
    <view class="boundary-rule" aria-hidden="true"></view>
    <text class="boundary-title">使用边界</text>
    <text class="boundary-text">本工具不能替代紧急服务、线下专业评估、法律判断或医疗诊断。安全风险出现时，请先停止独自处理。</text>
  </view>

  <button class="safe-outline-button bottom-action" hover-class="safe-active" bindtap="goGuide">查看紧急安全指引</button>
</view>
